<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Fixture with invented data in the structure of a DFS AIXM 5.1.1 airspace dataset.
  Covers the geometry constructs the importer has to handle: a stroked polygon, a circle by
  centre point, and a sector aggregated from two contributing airspaces.

  Every identifier, name, frequency and position here is invented. Only the structure
  follows the published format, so the importers can be tested without reproducing any
  part of a DFS dataset.
-->
